 "decisions_md": "### \u00a73.5.3a detectability check \u2014 development_only (WCTE LUCiD eaf2e89f config/WCTE_geom_config.json)\n\n- Geometry: `WCTE LUCiD eaf2e89f config/WCTE_geom_config.json`, digest `8b46bd3cbff4cc65ac4188e77cc42823cd6705ee63442a7e7f9d34f07dd198f1`, synthetic=false; readout `readout_pmt_r6`; code `c63fe740edf01bb46b8164dd48f3cfc24c9371f2`.\n- Response: `configs/lucid_pmt/reference.json` sha256 `17636f9bba69e10ea59bcbd83a884c003b4709ea5e1a6fabd94178a0be402e68` (charge gain {'rule': 'group_parity', 'base': 1.0, 'odd_group_delta': 0.03}, timing width {'rule': 'group_parity', 'base': 1.0, 'odd_group_delta': 0.05}); dark counts on (v_dark = 0.00109 = 0.001 x 1.09 PE^2, window [-200.0, 800.0] ns).\n- F3 marginalised: true at s_p = 0.1; variance `mu_p * (1 + sigma_spe^2) + v_dark + s_p^2 * mu_p^2`.\n- Yield range: `Y_lo = 6298.44`, `Y_hi = 539434` photons (provided); median yield `58288.9` (population_median_of_log_uniform).\n- N_min = 20 at Y_lo: within target median 104 hits (exclusion 0); across proxy median 96 hits (below-N_min 0).\n\n| factor | setting | R\u00b2_run (lower bound) | previous frozen R\u00b2_run | \u0394 | pass |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| F1 | 0.02 | 0.257 | 0.261 | -0.004 | false |\n| F1 | 0.05 | 0.684 | 0.686 | -0.002 | true |\n| F1 | 0.1 | 0.890 | 0.891 | -0.001 | true |\n| F3 | 0.1 | 0.323 | 0.323 | -0.001 | false |\n| F2 | 0.5 | 0.919 | 0.921 | -0.002 | true |\n| T | 0.5 | 0.986 | 0.986 | -0.000 | true |\n\n- Previous frozen ceilings (`/work/dwong/jepa_a10/results/jepa/20261017_wp4b_detectability/wp4b_detectability_wcte_v2.json`, sha256 `540e9b2e0acd6858e3269bb90732a912ac9462f734d79f7b21b38dbb89c9f03c`, status frozen, recorded as superseded_pending_r6_freeze): `Y_lo = 6249.71`, `Y_hi = 541561`, F2 {'law': 'F2', 'setting': 0.5}, F3 None, v_dark 0.0, readout `readout_synthetic_unrepaired`.\n- Intermediate run `28e24c8`: never_frozen (superseded_by_r6_dark_counts); the intermediate detectability run was never frozen and is superseded_by_r6_dark_counts; the last frozen values are this v2 file.\n- s_p restart: 0.1 -> 0.1 (registered default 0.05, step-3 cap 0.1); previous superseded_by_r6_dark_counts (28e24c8, never frozen); ladder ['raise_y_hi', 'set_F2_a/switch_F2p_b', 'raise_F3_spread'].\n\n- Fallback steps: 4 (raise_y_hi, set_F2_a, set_F2_a, raise_F3_spread).\n- F1 eligible: [0.05, 0.1]; excluded: [0.02].\n- F2 choice: {'law': 'F2', 'setting': 0.5} (attempted [0.1, 0.2, 0.5]); F3 choice: None.\n- R12: not_evaluable (no gate); law T >= 0.6: true.\n- G6: false for [].\n- One line: F3 cannot reach 0.6: R12 not_evaluable, no gate.",
